[mWork seamlessly with GitHub from the command line.

[m[22;1mUSAGE
[m  gh <command> <subcommand> [flags]

[m[22;1mCORE COMMANDS
[m  auth:          Authenticate gh and git with GitHub
[m  browse:        Open repositories, issues, pull requests, and more in the brows[mer
[m  codespace:     Connect to and manage codespaces
[m  discussion:    Work with GitHub Discussions (preview)
[m  gist:          Manage gists
[m  issue:         Manage issues
[m  org:           Manage organizations
[m  pr:            Manage pull requests
[m  project:       Work with GitHub Projects.
[m  release:       Manage releases
[m  repo:          Manage repositories
[m  skill:         Install and manage agent skills (preview)

[m[22;1mGITHUB ACTIONS COMMANDS
[m  cache:         Manage GitHub Actions caches
[m  run:           View details about workflow runs
[m  workflow:      View details about GitHub Actions workflows

[m[22;1mALIAS COMMANDS
[m  co:            Alias for "pr checkout"

[m[22;1mADDITIONAL COMMANDS
[m  agent-task:    Work with agent tasks (preview)
[m  alias:         Create command shortcuts
[m  api:           Make an authenticated GitHub API request
[m  attestation:   Work with artifact attestations
[m  completion:    Generate shell completion scripts
[m  config:        Manage configuration for gh
[m  copilot:       Run the GitHub Copilot CLI (preview)
[m  extension:     Manage gh extensions
[m  gpg-key:       Manage GPG keys
[m  label:         Manage labels
[m  licenses:      View third-party license information
[m  preview:       Execute previews for gh features
[m  ruleset:       View info about repo rulesets
[m  search:        Search for repositories, issues, and pull requests
[m  secret:        Manage GitHub secrets
[m  ssh-key:       Manage SSH keys
[m  status:        Print information about relevant issues, pull requests, and not[mifications across repositories
[m  variable:      Manage GitHub Actions variables

[m[22;1mHELP TOPICS
[m  accessibility: Learn about GitHub CLI's accessibility experiences
[m  actions:       Learn about working with GitHub Actions
[m  environment:   Environment variables that can be used with gh
[m  exit-codes:    Exit codes used by gh
[m  formatting:    Formatting options for JSON data exported from gh
[m  mintty:        Information about using gh with MinTTY
[m  reference:     A comprehensive reference of all gh commands
[m  telemetry:     Information about telemetry in gh

[m[22;1mFLAGS
[m  --help[=true|false]      Show help for command
[m  --version[=true|false]   Show gh version

[m[22;1mEXAMPLES
[m  $ gh issue create
[m  $ gh repo clone cli/cli
[m  $ gh pr checkout 321

[m[22;1mLEARN MORE
[m  Use `gh <command> <subcommand> --help` for more information about a command.
[m  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual
[m  Learn about exit codes using `gh help exit-codes`
[m  Learn about accessibility experiences using `gh help accessibility`
